WEBVTT

00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:00.421
Hello.

00:00:00.471 --> 00:00:02.441
I'm Luca, an AI avatar.

00:00:02.491 --> 00:00:04.949
This video is for
teachers and parents and

00:00:04.999 --> 00:00:06.932
briefly explains
the rules of the

00:00:06.982 --> 00:00:09.439
Graduation party 2027
website of the class

00:00:09.489 --> 00:00:09.964
of 2027.

00:00:10.014 --> 00:00:11.853
The sign-in portal,
the profile card

00:00:11.903 --> 00:00:13.895
feature and the photo
upload are a plan

00:00:13.945 --> 00:00:14.865
and not built yet.

00:00:14.940 --> 00:00:17.171
Every child in the
class can describe

00:00:17.221 --> 00:00:19.452
another child, as
a profile card with

00:00:19.502 --> 00:00:21.853
fixed fields or as
a portrait, a short,

00:00:21.903 --> 00:00:23.774
kind text of at
most 120 words.

00:00:23.824 --> 00:00:25.812
The described child
checks the text, can

00:00:25.862 --> 00:00:27.552
improve it, and
decides whether it

00:00:27.602 --> 00:00:28.000
appears.

00:00:28.070 --> 00:00:30.301
The process: the
writing child chooses

00:00:30.351 --> 00:00:31.354
whom to describe.

00:00:31.404 --> 00:00:33.324
While writing, the
check runs, and

00:00:33.374 --> 00:00:35.576
anything not allowed
is blocked at once

00:00:35.626 --> 00:00:36.420
and not saved.

00:00:36.470 --> 00:00:38.719
The text goes as a
draft to the described

00:00:38.769 --> 00:00:40.471
child, who sees
it alone first.

00:00:40.521 --> 00:00:43.037
They can improve,
reject or approve it.

00:00:43.087 --> 00:00:45.513
For children under
16, the parents must

00:00:45.563 --> 00:00:46.317
consent too.

00:00:46.367 --> 00:00:48.541
Only after both
approvals is the text

00:00:48.591 --> 00:00:49.067
visible.

00:00:49.117 --> 00:00:51.373
Without approval it
stays invisible and is

00:00:51.423 --> 00:00:52.606
deleted after 30 days.

00:00:52.680 --> 00:00:54.668
Consent can be withdrawn
at any time, and

00:00:54.718 --> 00:00:56.512
the text is then
deleted immediately.

00:00:56.562 --> 00:00:58.614
Feedback always goes
through the described

00:00:58.664 --> 00:01:00.374
child, never through
third parties.

00:01:00.440 --> 00:01:02.472
If something is blocked,
the writing child

00:01:02.522 --> 00:01:04.554
gets a friendly message
without blame, for

00:01:04.604 --> 00:01:06.442
example: we can't
save that like this.

00:01:06.492 --> 00:01:08.057
Write something you
would also like to

00:01:08.107 --> 00:01:08.927
read about yourself.

00:01:08.977 --> 00:01:10.702
The blocked text
is not saved.

00:01:10.770 --> 00:01:13.368
Blocked are swear words
and insults in all

00:01:13.418 --> 00:01:15.893
spellings, mockery,
put-downs, bullying,

00:01:15.943 --> 00:01:17.740
threats, exposure
and rumors.

00:01:17.790 --> 00:01:20.214
Also sexual content,
violence, drugs,

00:01:20.264 --> 00:01:22.688
alcohol and nicotine,
and hints about

00:01:22.738 --> 00:01:25.096
health, origin,
religion, family and

00:01:25.146 --> 00:01:25.877
appearance.

00:01:25.927 --> 00:01:27.987
Even unkindness wrapped
in friendly words

00:01:28.037 --> 00:01:28.388
counts.

00:01:28.460 --> 00:01:29.760
The check has five levels.

00:01:29.810 --> 00:01:31.986
One, word lists
and patterns.

00:01:32.036 --> 00:01:34.064
Two, an AI moderation
for content, tone

00:01:34.114 --> 00:01:34.740
and attacks.

00:01:34.790 --> 00:01:37.503
Three, a positive
template that steers

00:01:37.553 --> 00:01:39.275
toward friendly wording.

00:01:39.325 --> 00:01:41.908
Four, the veto of
the described child.

00:01:41.958 --> 00:01:43.951
Five, the report
to the committee or

00:01:44.001 --> 00:01:45.940
teacher, who can
block at any time.

00:01:46.020 --> 00:01:47.405
No check catches everything.

00:01:47.455 --> 00:01:49.175
That is why nothing
appears without the

00:01:49.225 --> 00:01:50.635
approval of the
described child.

00:01:50.685 --> 00:01:52.902
Only first names or
initials are used, no

00:01:52.952 --> 00:01:53.550
last names.

00:01:53.620 --> 00:01:56.086
On data protection:
no information about

00:01:56.136 --> 00:01:58.295
health, origin,
religion or family.

00:01:58.345 --> 00:02:00.174
The site is public,
so only with the

00:02:00.224 --> 00:02:01.697
consent of child
and parents.

00:02:01.747 --> 00:02:03.675
Everything is deleted
after the graduation

00:02:03.725 --> 00:02:05.424
party, at the latest
after the school

00:02:05.474 --> 00:02:07.126
year, and immediately
on withdrawal.

00:02:07.220 --> 00:02:09.450
Why offer the project
with AI support?

00:02:09.500 --> 00:02:11.774
The work is demanding
over months, and big

00:02:11.824 --> 00:02:14.099
projects often fail
because the work stops

00:02:14.149 --> 00:02:14.694
being fun.

00:02:14.744 --> 00:02:16.773
The AI decides
nothing: the children

00:02:16.823 --> 00:02:18.685
remain the authors,
the committee

00:02:18.735 --> 00:02:19.247
approves.

00:02:19.297 --> 00:02:21.398
Building by hand is
equally valid, and

00:02:21.448 --> 00:02:22.611
nobody has to use AI.

00:02:22.700 --> 00:02:26.298
A rough estimate until
July 2027: by hand

00:02:26.348 --> 00:02:29.771
100 to 170 hours,
with AI support 20 to

00:02:29.821 --> 00:02:30.119
30.

00:02:30.169 --> 00:02:33.759
Building the site: 25
to 40 hours versus 3

00:02:33.809 --> 00:02:34.266
to 5.

00:02:34.316 --> 00:02:37.368
The video: 15 to
30 versus 2 to 3.

00:02:37.418 --> 00:02:40.364
The photos: 20 to
30 versus 5 to 8.

00:02:40.414 --> 00:02:43.686
Upkeep until July:
40 to 70 versus 10 to

00:02:43.736 --> 00:02:44.011
15.

00:02:44.100 --> 00:02:46.375
To finish: the sign-in
portal, the profile

00:02:46.425 --> 00:02:48.537
card feature and the
photo upload are a

00:02:48.587 --> 00:02:49.672
plan, not built yet.

00:02:49.722 --> 00:02:51.727
A flyer for parents
is on the page to

00:02:51.777 --> 00:02:52.268
download.

00:02:52.318 --> 00:02:53.300
Thank you for your time.

